%% Flow: Binance depth becomes the tradable ladder and the displayed order book.
%% Solid arrow = synchronous call. Dashed arrow = return, async or emitted event.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BN as EXTERNAL - Binance public API
    box rgb(232,244,255) spotapi - all one process
    participant WS as lib/binanceWebSocket.js
    participant CACHE as orderBookCache in memory
    participant DS as lib/depthSource.js
    participant DH as lib/depthHealth.js
    participant PB as paperBook.controller.js
    participant BP as bookPublish.controller.js
    participant SK as socket.io
    end
    participant RD as Redis depth mirror
    actor T as Trader browser

    Note over BN,T: BOOT - 5s after listen, one stream pair per active binance pair

    WS->>BN: GET /api/v3/depth limit 1000
    BN-->>WS: snapshot with lastUpdateId
    WS->>CACHE: clear, repopulate bids and asks, set lastUpdateId
    WS->>BN: open wss depth@100ms
    WS->>BN: open wss aggTrade

    Note over BN,T: STEADY STATE - every ~100ms

    BN-->>WS: depth diff event U..u
    alt gap detected - firstUpdateId > lastUpdateId + 1
        WS->>CACHE: zero lastUpdateId FIRST so later events buffer
        WS->>BN: re-fetch snapshot
        WS->>CACHE: processBufferedEvents then replay
    else contiguous
        WS->>CACHE: applyDepthEvent - delete on qty 0, else set
    end
    WS->>RD: mirrorDepthToRedis - top 20 per side plus meta ts
    WS-->>BP: notifyDepthListener - injected via setDepthListener

    Note over BN,T: DERIVATION - one snapshot, one verdict, two consumers

    BP->>DS: resolveDepthSnapshot
    DS->>CACHE: getDepthSnapshot - memory first
    alt memory miss
        DS->>RD: redisDepthFallback
    end
    DS-->>BP: snapshot tagged memory or redis
    BP->>DH: assessDepthHealth
    DH-->>BP: healthy, or breaker reason

    PB->>DS: resolveDepthSnapshot - the SAME function
    PB->>DH: assessDepthHealth - the SAME verdict
    PB->>PB: buildPaperOrders - group to MIN_NOTIONAL 25, quote worst price, 12 levels
    PB->>RD: hdel last cycle rows then hset admin-owned ladder

    BP->>RD: hgetall open orders to merge real user levels
    BP->>BP: drop user levels that cross venue best, slice to 20
    alt zero isPaper rows found in redis
        BP->>BP: publish empty book, reason ladder_not_built
    end
    BP-->>SK: socketEmitAll orderBook - GLOBAL broadcast
    SK-->>T: orderBook with seq, healthy, ladderPresent
    BN-->>WS: aggTrade events
    WS-->>SK: socketEmitAll recentTrade - buffered 250ms
    SK-->>T: recentTrade
